00:41:05.380 --> 00:41:10.880
That is God's heart and desire for every single one of us. And I want to invite us to really seek

00:41:10.880 --> 00:41:12.820
him for that together as we close out our time

00:41:12.820 --> 00:41:13.380
this morning.
